pan data-lake-id=\"uc8a0b6f6\" id=\"uc8a0b6f6\">人工介入率</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u374a8545\" id=\"u374a8545\">：从20%降至8%（通过自动化回复与优先级排序）。</span></li><li fid=\"u29ae707c\" data-lake-id=\"u3185b763\" id=\"u3185b763\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uda091992\" id=\"uda091992\">用户满意度</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u409324f6\" id=\"u409324f6\">：NPS评分从72提升至85（通过情感分析与个性化回复）。</span></li></ul><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22n2naz%22%7D\"></card><h4 data-lake-id=\"303c56e5\" id=\"303c56e5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue4081ceb\" id=\"ue4081ceb\">3. 技术选型与扩展性设计</span></strong></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ud25eb1bd\" id=\"ud25eb1bd\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1752484658456-3ab327d6-dbe6-4c67-a9f7-1dcc0ca2dc94.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u5de76394-b075-4243-9b55-6a3870545c7%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u96795bf1-6b49-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A554%2C%22height%22%3A183%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A51848%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A831%2C%22originHeight%22%3A275%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.5%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BA%94%2C%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E8%AE%BE%E8%AE%A1%22%2C%22x%22%3A42%2C%22y%22%3A125%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A29%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E9%AB%98%E5%B9%B6%E5%8F%91%22%2C%22x%22%3A610%2C%22y%22%3A225%2C%22width%22%3A144%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ERNIE%E6%83%85%E6%84%9F%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A609%2C%22y%22%3A95%2C%22width%22%3A164%2C%22height%22%3A26%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ROBERTA%E5%88%86%E7%B1%BB%22%2C%22x%22%3A612%2C%22y%22%3A32%2C%22width%22%3A151%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BE%AE%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E8%A7%A3%E7%A8%A0%22%2C%22x%22%3A607%2C%22y%22%3A161%2C%22width%22%3A123%2C%22height%